    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbafcStaffalsoa]{Staff}, Very Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This staff can be wielded as a magic @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepQuartersta]{Quarterstaff} that grants a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with it.</p><p>The staff has 3 charges. While holding the staff, you can expend 1 charge to cast either @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMaze000000]{Maze} (save DC 18) or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTeleport00]{Teleport} from it. When the staff has no more charges remaining, it loses its magic and becomes a nonmagical @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepQuartersta]{Quarterstaff}.</p><p><strong>Curse.</strong> This staff is cursed. Becoming attuned to it extends the curse to you. As long as you remain cursed, you are unwilling to part with the staff, keeping it on your person at all times.</p><p>While attuned to this staff, you never know which way is north, and you have Disadvantage on Wisdom (Survival) checks made to navigate. Additionally, whenever you expend a charge from the staff, roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1, [[/r 1d4]] @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmMinotaurOfBaph]{Minotaurs of Baphomet} materialize, each appearing in an unoccupied space within 30 feet of you. The minotaurs begin combat with you immediately.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-bPtGSvbbXTxIqEFf\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>La malédiction est rappelée par l’effet <em>Curse of the Lost</em> sur le porteur. Le désavantage en Survival ne vaut que pour s’orienter : appliquez-le à la main. Dans dnd5e, Maze n’a pas de jet de sauvegarde : la cible s’échappe par un test d’Intelligence (Investigation) DD 20, à remplacer à la main si le DD 18 de la fiche doit s’y appliquer.</p></section>",
